abstract: >-
  A written exceptional-parameter homology classification and independent exact
  finite-field replay for a specified seed complex in OpenAI's Family 199.
  Generic exactness is already in the source Lean development. No claim about
  alternate constructions, the full counterexample, or human peer review.
  Substantial OpenAI Codex assistance is disclosed.
